<newsitem itemid="118410" id="root" date="1996-10-15" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on French Cyclical basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on French Cyclical basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued 250,000 American-style call warrants on a French cyclical basket. The basket includes Usinor, Pechiney.A, Peugeot, Lafarge and Saint Gobain lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    5000 FRF		  ISSUE PRICE    439 FRF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	14.OCT.97		 PAYDATE	05.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING APPLIED-PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  4970 FRF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
